---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Vivify Signage Coimbatore"
  description="Terms of Service and warranty conditions for Vivify Signage, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu."
>
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#07090e]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Vivify Signage, Ganapathy, Coimbatore</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed  pt-8">
        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern all signage design, CNC routing, acrylic fabrication, ACP elevation cladding, and installation services provided by Vivify Signage.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">1. Quotations and Approvals</h2>
        <p>
          All project estimates are based on initial site measurements or client-provided architectural blueprints. Fabrication commences only after the client approves final 2D/3D visual proofs, material selections, and lighting specifications.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">2. Material Quality & Electrical Ratings</h2>
        <p>
          We employ cast acrylic, exterior-grade Aluminum Composite Panels (ACP), and certified IP67 waterproof LED modules. Standard electrical components require appropriate client-supplied surge protection and earthing provisions at the mounting location.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">3. Warranty Coverage</h2>
        <p>
          Vivify Signage provides manufacturer warranties on LED modules and power supplies ranging from 1 to 3 years depending on the selected hardware tier. Warranty covers driver defects and LED diode failures under normal operating conditions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">4. On-Site Installation & Rigging</h2>
        <p>
          Installation crews adhere to standard safety and structural anchoring protocols. Clients must ensure clear building access and uninterrupted electrical supply during scheduled mounting windows.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
